<section class="page-hero compact"><div class="container"><div class="eyebrow">DEVELOPMENT ONLY — NO MONEY COLLECTED</div><h1>Payments &amp; Fee Waivers</h1><p>Manage a simulated exam price and limited school/university coupon allocations.</p></div></section>
<section class="container section"><%- include('partials-nav') %><div class="alert alert-warning"><strong>SANDBOX MODE.</strong> No real payment processing, funds, bank account or official institution verification is connected. This is an internal pilot tool. <%= enabled?'Sandbox is enabled locally.':'Sandbox is disabled in this environment.' %></div>
<div class="card-grid two"><div class="panel"><h2>Exam price (demo only)</h2><form method="post" action="/admin/fees/price" class="form-stack"><input type="hidden" name="_csrf" value="<%= csrf %>"><div class="field"><label for="fee">Test price in UZS</label><input type="number" name="exam_fee_uzs" id="fee" min="10000" max="50000000" required value="<%= price %>"></div><button class="btn btn-primary">Update price for new bookings</button></form><small>Existing payment orders retain their original price.</small></div>
<div class="panel"><h2>Simulation overview</h2><p>Sandbox orders: <strong><%= overview.count %></strong></p><p>Settled/waived: <strong><%= overview.settled %></strong></p><p>Simulated amount due marked paid: <strong><%= overview.demo_amount.toLocaleString('en-US') %> UZS</strong></p><small>Numbers are fictional transactions and are NOT actual revenue.</small></div></div>
<div class="card-grid two mt"><div class="panel"><h2>Add a partner institution</h2><p>A school or university can distribute codes, but receives no GEST admin account.</p><form method="post" action="/admin/fees/institutions" class="form-stack"><input type="hidden" name="_csrf" value="<%= csrf %>"><div class="field"><label for="iname">Name</label><input required minlength="3" maxlength="120" id="iname" name="name" placeholder="Example Secondary School"></div><div class="field"><label for="ikind">Type</label><select name="kind" id="ikind"><option value="school">School</option><option value="university">University</option><option value="nonprofit">Nonprofit</option><option value="partner">Partner</option></select></div><button class="btn btn-primary">Add institution</button></form></div>
<div class="panel"><h2>Issue a coupon allocation</h2><p>Each generated code works once. Codes are shown only immediately after creation.</p><form method="post" action="/admin/fees/batches" class="form-stack"><input type="hidden" name="_csrf" value="<%= csrf %>"><div class="field"><label for="inst">Institution</label><select id="inst" name="institution_id" required><option value="">Choose institution</option><% institutions.filter(i=>i.active).forEach(i=>{ %><option value="<%= i.id %>"><%= i.name %> — <%= i.kind %></option><% }) %></select></div><div class="field"><label for="ctr">Valid test centre</label><select id="ctr" name="centre_id"><option value="">All active centres</option><% centres.forEach(c=>{ %><option value="<%= c.id %>"><%= c.code %> — <%= c.name %></option><% }) %></select></div><div class="field"><label for="percent">Discount</label><select id="percent" name="percent"><option value="25">25%</option><option value="50">50%</option><option value="100">100%</option></select></div><div class="field"><label for="quantity">Number of one-use codes (1–100)</label><input id="quantity" name="quantity" type="number" value="10" min="1" max="100" required></div><div class="field"><label for="expiry">Expiry date</label><input id="expiry" name="expiry_date" type="date" required></div><button class="btn btn-primary" <%= enabled?'':'disabled' %>>Generate codes once</button></form></div></div>
<h2 class="mt">Institutions</h2><div class="table-wrap"><table><thead><tr><th>Institution</th><th>Type</th><th>Status</th><th>Action</th></tr></thead><tbody><% institutions.forEach(i=>{ %><tr><td><%= i.name %></td><td><%= i.kind %></td><td><%= i.active?'Active':'Inactive' %></td><td><form method="post" action="/admin/fees/institutions/<%= i.id %>/status" class="inline"><input type="hidden" name="_csrf" value="<%= csrf %>"><input type="hidden" name="active" value="<%= i.active?0:1 %>"><button class="btn btn-small btn-secondary"><%= i.active?'Deactivate':'Activate' %></button></form></td></tr><% }) %><% if(!institutions.length){ %><tr><td colspan="4">No institutions have been added.</td></tr><% } %></tbody></table></div>
<h2 class="mt">Coupon allocations</h2><div class="table-wrap"><table><thead><tr><th>Batch</th><th>Institution</th><th>Discount</th><th>Centre</th><th>Used / total</th><th>Expires</th><th>Status</th><th>Action</th></tr></thead><tbody><% batches.forEach(b=>{ %><tr><td>#<%= b.id %></td><td><%= b.institution_name %></td><td><%= b.percent %>%</td><td><%= b.centre_code||'All centres' %></td><td><%= b.redeemed %> / <%= b.quantity %></td><td><%= b.expiry_date %></td><td><%= b.active?'Active':'Inactive' %></td><td><form method="post" action="/admin/fees/batches/<%= b.id %>/status"><input type="hidden" name="_csrf" value="<%= csrf %>"><input type="hidden" name="active" value="<%= b.active?0:1 %>"><button class="btn btn-small btn-secondary"><%= b.active?'Disable remaining codes':'Enable remaining codes' %></button></form></td></tr><% }) %><% if(!batches.length){ %><tr><td colspan="8">No coupons allocated yet.</td></tr><% } %></tbody></table></div></section>
